   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 7.483
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-01",
   "text": "起因，是此前的一次升级。",
   "spoken": "起因，是此前的一次升级。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg1-01.mp3",
   "start": 8.54,
   "dur": 3.0,
   "speechStart": 8.638,
   "speechEnd": 10.709
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-02",
   "text": "这次升级调用了初始化函数，把可信的消息根，设成了全零。",
   "spoken": "这次升级掉用了初始化函数，把可信的消息根，设成了全零。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg1-02.mp3",
   "start": 11.76,
   "dur": 5.76,
   "speechStart": 11.858,
   "speechEnd": 16.691
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-03",
   "text": "桥合约收到一条消息，先查它对应的根，再看这个根是否可信。",
   "spoken": "桥合约收到一条消息，先查它对应的根，再看这个根是否可信。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg1-03.mp3",
   "start": 17.74,
   "dur": 5.64,
   "speechStart": 17.838,
   "speechEnd": 22.528
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-04",
   "text": "先猜一道题。",
   "spoken": "先猜一道题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg1-04.mp3",
   "start": 23.6,
   "dur": 2.088,
   "speechStart": 23.698,
   "speechEnd": 24.852
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-05",
   "text": "一条从没被证明过的消息，查到的根是什么？它能通过吗？",
   "spoken": "一条从没被证明过的消息，查到的根是什么？它能通过吗？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg1-05.mp3",
   "start": 25.908,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 26.006,
   "speechEnd": 30.587
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-06",
   "text": "它查到的是默认值，全零。",
   "spoken": "它查到的是默认值，全零。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg1-06.mp3",
   "start": 31.928,
   "dur": 3.216,
   "speechStart": 32.026,
   "speechEnd": 34.323
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-07",
   "text": "而全零，刚刚被这次升级，标记成了可信。",
   "spoken": "而全零，刚刚被这次升级，标记成了可信。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg1-07.mp3",
   "start": 35.364,
   "dur": 4.344,
   "speechStart": 35.462,
   "speechEnd": 38.866
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-08",
   "text": "所以，任何消息都被视为已经证明。",
   "spoken": "所以，任何消息都被视为已经证明。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg1-08.mp3",
